  <trk>
    <name>Foppa Trail</name>
    <desc>Are you looking for an easy start to biking, but want to ride &quot;real&quot; trails? The Foppa Trail is the perfect trail for newcomers and families. Easy, safe and extremely fun. Access is also totally effortless with the mountain railway!</desc>
